<phrase>
    <source>WARNING:
Any setting other than “No rounding” may cause rendering errors in the project, depending on:

1 - the selected setting 
2 - the screen&apos;s dpi 
3 - editing the project on another computer and/or screen that does not have the same settings as in points 1 and 2.</source>
    <target>UPOZORENJE:
Svaka vrijednost osim &apos;Bez zaokruživanja&apos; može uzrokovati pogreške u prikazu projekta ovisno o:

1 - odabranoj vrijednosti 
2 - dpi zaslonu 
3 - izmjeni projekta na drugom računalu i/ili zaslonu koji nema iste postavke iz točaka 1 i 2.</target>
</phrase>
